WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.750
-[alarm blaring]
-[all screaming]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.708
Turn that off, Joy!

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.208
[Fear] People,
it's the apocalypse!

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:13.375
No!

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:14.666
What are you doing?

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:17.416
[grunts] Um...

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.291
[panting]

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.541
[chuckles] Whoo!

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.500
Problem solved.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:30.583
Joy.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.083
-[glass shatters]
-[all screaming]

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:37.708
Okay, let's clear it all out.

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:40.250
-It's demo day.
-[workers cheering]

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.791
[Joy] Demo?

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:44.291
Wait, wait, what's happening?

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:46.041
What's going on?

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.708
-[roaring]
-Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.291
-[worker grunts]
-[screams] Who are you people?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:52.500
[screams]

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.375
-[screams]
-[worker laughs]

00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:56.500
Hey, are you the one
in charge here? [exclaims]

00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:58.375
Could you do me
a favor and stop

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.875
tearing Headquarters apart?

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:01.250
No can do. Didn't you hear?

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:02.458
Permits just came through.

00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:04.083
Permits? For what?

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:05.541
For expanding the place.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:07.041
You know, for the others.

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:08.125
-[worker exclaims]
-[Joy coughs]

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:09.208
What others?

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:11.500
They're not here yet?
Aye, yi, yi.

00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:13.291
Hey, Margie,
you got that console?

00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:15.125
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Give me a sec!

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.208
Hey, hey! What are you doing?

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:18.291
-All right. She's all set.
-Set with what?

00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:19.875
[Dad] Come on, Riley. Get up.

00:01:20.041 --> 00:01:21.625
-Camp time.
-[groans softly]

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:23.291
Lunch break!

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.375
[workers chattering]

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.166
Wait, wait!
You can't leave it like this.

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:27.708
Don't worry, we'll be back.

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:29.041
[Dad] Come on.
We're gonna be late.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.833
-Oh, no, no, no!
-[Dad] Let's go!

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:32.375
[groaning]

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:35.833
Riley, you aren't packed yet?

00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:39.208
Ugh! You're always on me!

00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:41.958
Can't you just lay off for,
like, one second?

00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:43.625
Uh, overreact much?

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:45.166
I barely touched it.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.208
Those morons
broke the console.

00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.083
Riley, what's wrong?

00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:51.333
-Oh, Mom looks sad.
-[console clicks]

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.541
I'm the worst!

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:55.375
-[Mom] Oh, no. Honey.
-[crying]

00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:56.875
I barely touched it.

00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:58.083
That's what I said.

00:01:58.166 --> 00:01:59.333
[sobbing]

00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:01.041
[sniffing]

00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:04.875
Let the professional
handle this.

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:10.791
I'm too gross to go to camp
or anywhere ever again!

00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:12.791
Oh, yeah,
this is totally broken.

00:02:13.958 --> 00:02:16.083
Well, we all knew
this day would come.

00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.708
Remember, we agreed not to
make a big deal about this.

00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:20.125
-But she really does stink.
-[all agree]

00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:21.291
Oh, it's bad.

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:24.250
Remain calm.
Stick to the prepared script.

00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:26.666
You are not gross, honey.

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:28.875
You're just changing.

00:02:29.041 --> 00:02:30.541
Remember that
beautiful butterfly

00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.166
we saw in the park last week?

00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:33.708
[echoing] Well, that butterfly
began as a caterpillar.

00:02:33.791 --> 00:02:34.791
[Joy] Easy...

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:35.958
[Mom] And just like
that caterpillar...

00:02:36.041 --> 00:02:37.083
Easy...

00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:38.291
...you're about to
get your wings.

00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:40.250
-But if you have questions...
-Oh, my gosh, Mom!

00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:42.541
Just go away! Ugh!

00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.083
Well, that's a preview
of the next 10 years.

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:48.416
-Riley!
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.583
-We're gonna have so much fun!
-[Dad] All right.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.625
Who's ready for hockey camp?

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:52.750
[girls] Oh, yeah!

00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:54.291
[Joy] Okay, until we can
figure this out,

00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:57.291
nobody touch the console
unless you really need to.

00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.500
So, big weekend for us.
What do you wanna do?

00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.375
Well, we could finally
clean out the garage.

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:05.041
Or, actually,
we can get upstairs...

00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:07.291
How great
is next year gonna be?

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.791
Coach Roberts' team has been
state champs like every year.

00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:14.458
And Val Ortiz
is the captain now.

00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:17.583
This Valentina Ortiz obsession
is outta control.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.250
Uh, she made the Fire Hawks
when she was only a freshman.

00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:22.125
That's really hard.

00:03:22.291 --> 00:03:24.291
All we have to do
is be super awesome at camp,

00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:28.291
Coach will put us on the team,
and we'll all be Fire Hawks!

00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:30.625
-Wait, what was that?
-What was what?

00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:32.666
We got a look.
I don't like this.

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.083
What? You're paranoid.

00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:35.333
I never miss a look.

00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.208
[Disgust] Enhance 224... 176.

00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:42.000
Track right. Zoom in.

00:03:42.416 --> 00:03:44.500
Right there!

00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:46.625
-So?
-She's hiding something.

00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:48.041
But what?

00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:51.708
What is she doing?

00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:53.041
She's looking at our look!

00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:55.916
No, it's much more than that.

00:03:58.541 --> 00:03:59.666
She looks the same to me.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.083
Overlay and compare.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.875
See? Riley then, Riley now.
Riley then, Riley now.

00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:06.500
-[all gasp, exclaim]
-Oh, It's so obvious!

00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:07.750
But what does it mean?

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.541
She knows
we're hiding something.

00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:13.666
What is happening right now?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.750
I don't know! I don't know!

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:16.958
-I can't take this anymore!
-Ah!

00:04:17.041 --> 00:04:18.625
You spilled the tea!

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.625
Coach Roberts isn't gonna be
our coach next year.

00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:21.791
Grace!

00:04:21.875 --> 00:04:22.916
[whimpers]

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.041
We... We got assigned to
a different high school.

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:28.166
A-ha! Oh...

00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:30.375
Oh, no.

00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:31.541
Oh...

00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:32.791
Okay. Um...

00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:34.583
Yeah. No big deal.

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.708
-This is a huge deal!
-Our life is over!

00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:37.958
Is she serious right now?

00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:39.041
How long have they known this?

00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:40.125
-[Fear] I can't breathe.
-We can't go to high school

00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:42.583
-without Bree and Grace.
-We won't know anybody.

00:04:42.666 --> 00:04:43.958
We'll still get to hang out.

00:04:44.041 --> 00:04:45.666
And we'll have this weekend,

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.416
which means
we'll get one last time

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.625
playing on the same team.

00:04:48.791 --> 00:04:50.625
Friends are forever, right?

00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:53.583
Yeah. Of course.

00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:54.708
[both] Whoo!

00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:56.125
I can't wait
to get to the rink.

00:04:56.291 --> 00:04:57.291
When do we get our schedules?

00:04:57.375 --> 00:04:59.708
[Grace]
I heard our room has a view...

00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:01.750
Oh, this is so sad.

00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:03.416
No, wait, Sadness!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.875
-No, no, no! Don't!
-I don't have a good grip!

00:05:05.083 --> 00:05:06.916
Just keep it together
until we're out of the car.

00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:09.541
[Dad] Here we are.

00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:11.833
This looks really cool.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.541
Are you sure you don't need
an assistant coach?

00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:14.625
'Cause I am available.

00:05:14.791 --> 00:05:16.125
[Mom] Bill!
[Dad] No? All right.

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:17.708
-We'll see you in a few days.
-[Mom] Have fun!

00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:18.916
-[Bree] Thanks so much. Bye!
-Don't miss us too much.

00:05:19.083 --> 00:05:20.791
-Okay, bye!
-Wait. Riley,

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:22.250
are you sure
you have everything?

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:23.375
-Stick?
-Yes.

00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:24.458
-Gloves?
-Yes.

00:05:24.541 --> 00:05:25.833
-You have your phone?
-Yes, of course.

00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:27.500
-Fully charged?
-Yeah, it's like 50.

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:28.666
-What?
-Dad, it's fine.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:30.291
Okay, call us if you need us.

00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:31.458
I love you. Go get 'em.

00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:32.666
Okay. Love you guys.

00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:34.958
-Don't forget the deodorant!
-Mom!

00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:36.166
Bye, monkey.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.833
Okay, now.

00:05:41.416 --> 00:05:43.416
[crying]

00:05:45.916 --> 00:05:48.208
It's okay. We need this.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.750
[sniffles]

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.500
[gasps]

00:05:53.958 --> 00:05:55.875
[Disgust] Guys,
these are high-schoolers.

00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:57.000
-Oh...
-We do not wanna be

00:05:57.083 --> 00:05:58.083
red and puffy, do we?

00:05:58.166 --> 00:05:59.166
No.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.916
Don't worry,
we'll have plenty of time

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.791
to think about this
after camp.

00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:04.958
Now, where did
Bree and Grace go?

00:06:05.458 --> 00:06:06.833
-Oh! There they are.
-Wait.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.958
Aren't those traitors
dead to us?

00:06:09.125 --> 00:06:10.833
Our best friends?
[scoffs] No.

00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:14.166
[girl] Whoa! Hey!

00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:16.125
Are you okay?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.333
[gasps] Everybody act regular.
It's Valentina Ortiz.

00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:20.625
-Ah!
-We gotta say something.

00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:22.875
-Uh...
-Hey.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.583
-Hi. I'm Val...
-I know.

00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:25.666
You're the varsity captain,

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.375
you set the all-time
goal record as a junior,

00:06:27.458 --> 00:06:28.708
your favorite color's red,
and your skates...

00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:29.875
What are we saying?

00:06:29.958 --> 00:06:31.208
We are so uncool.

00:06:31.291 --> 00:06:33.166
Why are we
still holding her hand?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.916
Just like me.
[gasps, chuckles nervously]

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.833
Oh, you're the one
Coach told us about.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.750
Riley, from Michigan, right?

00:06:38.916 --> 00:06:40.500
-It's Minnesota, sweetie.
-No, no, no.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:42.833
We cannot correct Val Ortiz.

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:45.375
[laughs] Yeah, that's me.

00:06:45.541 --> 00:06:47.958
Riley from good old Michigan.

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:50.750
Orange?
Who made the console orange?

00:06:50.916 --> 00:06:52.500
-Do I look orange?
-I didn't touch it.

00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:54.083
-Orange is not my color.
-Not me.

00:06:54.833 --> 00:06:57.083
-Hello, everybody.
-[all scream]

00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:59.666
Oh, my gosh. I am just
such a huge fan of yours.

00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:02.666
And now, here I am,
meeting you, face to face.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.583
[squeals]
Okay. How can I help?

00:07:04.666 --> 00:07:05.958
-Uh... [exclaims]
-I can take notes,

00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:07.500
get coffee, manage your
calendar, walk your dog,

00:07:07.666 --> 00:07:09.166
carry your things,
watch you sleep.

00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:11.958
Wow! You have a lot of energy.
[chuckles]

00:07:12.458 --> 00:07:13.916
Maybe you could just
stay in one place.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.000
Anything.

00:07:15.166 --> 00:07:16.625
Just call my name,
and I am here for you.

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:17.833
Okay, love that.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.250
-And what was your name again?
-Oh.

00:07:19.416 --> 00:07:20.875
I'm sorry.
I can get ahead of myself.

00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:21.958
I'm Anxiety.

00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:23.333
I'm one of
Riley's new emotions.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.625
And we are just
super-jazzed to be here.

00:07:25.791 --> 00:07:27.000
Where can I put my stuff?

00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:28.500
Uh-uh-uh.
What do you mean "we"?

00:07:28.583 --> 00:07:29.583
[female voice
sighs in exasperation]

00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:32.166
[female voice] I wish I was
as tall as all of you. [grunts]

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.375
-Who the heck are you?
-[grunting, panting]

00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:35.708
I'm Envy.

00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:38.000
Oh! Look at your hair.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:40.000
-Oh, yeah, not happening.
-[gasps]

00:07:40.083 --> 00:07:41.375
Look at her hair!

00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:43.500
We need hair like that.

00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:46.083
Oh, my gosh.
I love the red in your hair.

00:07:46.166 --> 00:07:47.333
-Oh...
-[Disgust gasps]

00:07:47.416 --> 00:07:48.958
What are you doing?

00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:51.208
Hey,
maybe when I make the team,

00:07:51.291 --> 00:07:52.833
I can join Team Redhead, too!

00:07:52.916 --> 00:07:53.916
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:56.375
[whimpers]

00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:57.541
[gasps]

00:07:57.625 --> 00:07:58.958
Okay, who's this guy?

00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:00.833
What's your name, big fella?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.125
That's Embarrassment.

00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:03.708
He's not really big
on eye contact,

00:08:03.791 --> 00:08:05.583
or uh, like, good talking,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.041
but he's a really sweet guy.

00:08:07.208 --> 00:08:10.416
Well, welcome to Headquarters,
Embarrassment.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.125
Oh, we're doing a... No.

00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:13.333
No, going high. Oh.

